# Neovim Keybindings Reference

Leader Key: Space

## File Explorer (nvim-tree)
- Space + e: Toggle file explorer sidebar
- Enter or o (inside tree): Open selected file or toggle directory

## Search and Discovery (telescope.nvim)
- Space + f + f: Find files by name
- Space + f + g: Live grep (search text inside files)
- Space + f + b: Search open buffers
- Ctrl + o (inside Telescope): Open file in default external application (xdg-open)
- Tab (inside Telescope): Toggle multi-select mark on highlighted files
- Ctrl + q (inside Telescope): Send marked files to Quickfix list

## Tab Bar Navigation (bufferline.nvim)
- Shift + l: Switch to next tab on the right
- Shift + h: Switch to previous tab on the left

## Maintenance Commands
- :Lazy check: Check for available plugin updates
- :Lazy update: Update plugins and refresh lockfile
- :Lazy restore: Restore plugins matching lockfile
- :TSUpdate: Update and recompile Treesitter parsers


